+.class public final Lcom/android/keyguard/OnigiriCoverPin;
+# Onigiri: lays out the PIN bouncer for the Flip5 cover (748x720 px, 352x339 dp), where Samsung's
+# Fold5 cover sizes overflowed and cut off its top. The message and the PIN dots share one row
+# either side of the lock icon (the message shrinks to fit; the hint below it is dropped, as in
+# Samsung's landscape layout), the keypad (keys up to 54 dp) fills the middle, and emergency call
+# sits at the bottom: in the strip left of the cameras with swipe navigation (the view flipper
+# then keeps no bottom margin, see flipperBottom), else full width above the navigation bar. fit()
+# runs from KeyguardSecPINView.onMeasure, so it wins over Samsung's own layout passes. Built from
+# Java with javac and d8; the cover is the only near-square screen narrower than 420 dp.
